## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: |cff66ccffCombat|rKit: Reminder
## Notes: CombatKit module. Icons for what is missing before a pull: flask, food, augment rune, weapon oil, your class's buffs, a feast put down nearby. Loaded by CombatKit when the module is on.
## Notes-zhTW: CombatKit 模組。開怪前缺什麼就顯示圖示：精煉藥劑、食物、增強符文、武器油、你職業的 buff，還有附近放下的大餐。模組啟用時由 CombatKit 載入。
